1. Extend `FakeStreamFunction` and override `call` — the class isn't sealed/final; overriding `call` works. The subclass holds open the final stream. `stream.calls` getter works via contexts.
2. Change `cliFor` signature to accept `StreamFunction` — but other tests pass FakeStreamFunction and use `.calls`; changing the signature ripples. 

