{"content":"## Done — the backoff sleep now races the cancel token

`lib/src/agent/agent_loop_empty_completion.dart`, hiccup backoff:

```dart
if (delay > Duration.zero) {
  await Future.any<void>([
    Future<void>.delayed(delay),
    if (cancelToken != null) cancelToken.onCancel,
  ]);
}
```

A cancel landing during a backoff sleep wakes immediately instead of stalling for up to `emptyHiccupMaxBackoff` (8s default); the next `_streamAssistantResponse` short-circuits into `_abortedTurn` — no request leaves after cancel (E2 unchanged).

**Test** (`test/agent/agent_loop_test.dart`, gh-1577 group): *"E7: the backoff sleep is cancellation-aware — a cancel landing during the backoff does not wait out the delay"* — the abort fires 50ms into a 5s backoff; the run must settle `StopReason.aborted` in under 2s (it took ~5.0s before the fix, <100ms now).
